# The functions of Mission_TalkToTraitoriusAfterCTF in level gamblinden (the script levels/gamblinden/scripts/mission_talktotraitoriusafterctf.py of data03.packed) that are data: one section
# per function, its parameters after the name. The other functions of the script stay Python: InitStatus, Init, CreateTraitoriusInit, LaunchTraitoriusSpeech, SetNextMission.
# Made by a converter from the script. A pack in mods/ with scrapc/levels/gamblinden/mission_talktotraitoriusafterctf.def replaces this file.
section TraitoriusSpeech UsrName CharName optId FullOption
setvar Speech.PlayerName $UsrName
setvar Speech.NPCName $CharName
if $optId == "Talk"
	call Speech.OnSpch "Mission_CTFAgainstBankers_Traitorius_InitMsg1" "Mission_CTFAgainstBankers_Traitorius_InitAns1"
end
